  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Game::Game.Dialogue.ChoiceDialogueNode
  text: Forty now, and nothing said by me either. But Pell wants a name, and he'll keep counting till he gets one. So give him one. Pim, from the field gang. Slow lad, sleeps near the barn wall. I'll make sure a sack turns up under his blanket.
  nextNode: {fileID: 0}
